## Backend
- Edge Function `r2-expense-upload` (POST upload, DELETE remove) — zero dependencies
- Uses secrets: `R2_ACCOUNT_ID`, `R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`, `R2_BUCKET_NAME`, `R2_PUBLIC_URL`
